* Functional approximation for the Everlight H11L1 fitted in this schematic.
* Legacy public subcircuit name H11L1M retained for KiCad compatibility.
* Datasheet: https://en.everlight.com/wp-content/plugins/ItemRelationship/product_files/pdf/H11LX.pdf
* Not a manufacturer model; not validated over process/temperature.
* Same terminal order as the user's original model: A K VCC OUT GND.
* Open-collector output: external pull-up is required (R1 in this schematic).
* Assumed thresholds: ON 1.6 mA, OFF 1.0 mA, ratio 0.625.
* These select one curve using a maximum ON threshold and typical OFF threshold.
* They do not implement all production, temperature, supply or aging corners.
* Does not model supply current, switching delays, output leakage, or isolation limits.
.SUBCKT H11L1M A K VCC OUT GND
V_SENSE A LED_A 0
D_LED LED_A K LED_MOD
.MODEL LED_MOD D(IS=1p N=1.9 RS=1 CJO=100p BV=6 IBV=10u)

* 1000 V/A maps 1.6 mA to 1.6 V; no electrical HV-to-GLV connection.
* Simple power qualification below 3 V, not a detailed supply-startup model.
B_CTRL CTRL GND V={if(V(VCC,GND)<3,-1,1000*I(V_SENSE))}
S_OUT OUT GND CTRL GND SW_OPTO OFF
.MODEL SW_OPTO SW(RON=20 ROFF=1e12 VT=1.3 VH=0.3)
.ENDS H11L1M
